- RegionJourneyCore: optional per-route `landing` (JourneyLanding) overrides of the Landing A arrival numbers; routes
  without it (04→05, 08→09) are unchanged (asserted). Two new keys, default 0 = off: arrivalSettleM (lens progress eased
  over the last metres so it comes to rest with zero velocity/acceleration exactly when she stops) and anchorSmoothM
  (lens anchors on an exact triangular-kernel smoothing of her route, incl. the heading chord, so polyline corners no
  longer kick it). validateJourneyRoute rejects landing without focus / unknown or non-finite keys.
- region/LakesideCameraLayout.ts (pure): lakesideJourney(start) placement (yaw 180, root from the 04→05 approach end
  + 24 m bridge) and route pieces; landing {arrivalSideM +0.8 (her right), arrivalLiftM 0 (no crane-up),
  arrivalSettleM 6, anchorSmoothM 1.5}, focus = board centre; lakesideScenePose(aspect): 45° board camera solved per
  aspect (board ±0.88 NDC, far edge at 34% from the top), handoff FOV 61.928.
- test-lakeside-camera.cjs (+ lakeside/lakeside-scene.cjs, all 615 region_lakeside instances) in run-suite: K1-K7.
- Not included (Voice Bot's wiring): 'lakeside' in JourneyRegion/Place/State, island→lakeside region order,
  RegionJourneyAdapter.prepare mounting, board background lease using lakesideScenePose.

